The following amendments were made and passed at the May 18, 2020 Finance
Committee meeting.
22.
LEASES/CONTRACTS/LEGAL:

a)
Agreement between the City of Cheyenne, Laramie County, and Christensen’s Inc.,
granting an access easement for use and maintenance of an access road and drainage
conveyance across land owned by the City.  (revenue to the City) (POSTPONED
FROM 05-11-20)

Amended by substitute dated 05-18-20.  Substitute is attached.

b)
Agreement between the City of Cheyenne, Laramie County, and Christensen’s Inc.,
for driveway and drainage maintenance of an access road and drainage conveyance
across land owned by the City.  (POSTPONED FROM 05-11-20)

Amended by substitute dated 05-18-20.   Substitute is attached.

c)
Development Agreement between the City of Cheyenne and Leader Custom
Homes, LLC, for regrading, installation and construction of sidewalks, utilities,
drainage features and landscaping on City property in conjunction with
development of the Willow Heights Subdivision. (POSTPONED FROM           05-
11-20)

Amended by striking #2 (A) and re-lettering and by removing the 2nd, 3rd, 4th & 5th sentences
in the 2nd paragraph of the 04-27-20 staff memo relating to compensation of property use.

d)
Maintenance Agreement between the City of Cheyenne and Leader Custom
Homes, LLC, for maintenance of improvements made upon land owned by the City
in the area of the Willow Heights Subdivision.  (POSTPONED FROM      05-11-
20)

Amended by striking #2 (A) in Exhibit A and re-lettering and by removing the 2nd, 3rd, 4th &
5th sentences in the 2nd paragraph of the 04-27-20 staff memo relating to compensation of
property use.

e)
Hunter Management Agreement between the City of Cheyenne and Wyoming
Game & Fish Commission to allow public access for hunting on the Belvoir Ranch.

Amend by adding “Game Birds” to the approved species list.
